'''Skool''' is a [[Common Weapons|common]] knife that was originally obtainable by redeeming the [[Codes|code]] "B4CK2SK00L". It is now only obtainable through trading as the promo code has since expired. 

==Appearance ==
Skool appears to look like an ordinary pencil, but in the shape of a knife. The blade is yellow along with pencil lead on the tip. It also has a shiny silver guard, and a bright pink handle, resembling an eraser (or a "rubber" if you're in the UK).  

== Trivia ==
*Skool's code came out around when kids were going back to school. Users could redeem this for a period of time, before the code expired.
*Skool's texture and model was made by [[4Sci]], a former weapon skin creator for MM2.
**The texture can be found [https://www.roblox.com/library/178200933/pencilknife here].
**The model can be found [https://www.roblox.com/library/295267119/pencil-knife here].

